{"availability":"available","full":"LikithSh3tty/Agenvo","name":"Agenvo","description":"A deterministic, multi-tenant revenue-orchestration platform for agencies: automated commission-split invoicing, cross-currency reconciliation, and a LangGraph-routed conversational analytics layer grounded in isolated per-user Firestore state. React, Vite, Firebase, LangGraph, FastAPI, Claude, Vercel.","category":"Developer tools","language":"JavaScript","stars":0,"forks":0,"created":"2026-07-23T15:51:09Z","updated":"2026-08-01T12:42:18Z","branch":"main","homepage":"https://agenvox.vercel.app","topics":["anthropic","chatbot","claude","fastapi","firebase","firebase-authentication","firestore","invoicing","javascript","langchain","langgraph","multi-tenant","playwright","python","react","saas","serverless","uvicorn","vercel","vite"],"demo":"https://agenvox.vercel.app/","color":"#302e55","ink":"#dbd2ff","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-16T00:57:43.492Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-16T00:57:43.492Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-16T00:57:43.492Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-08T21:27:37.742Z","stars":0,"forks":0},{"at":"2026-10-11T13:37:06.332Z","stars":0,"forks":0},{"at":"2026-10-16T00:57:43.492Z","stars":0,"forks":0}],"technologies":["React","Python"],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["Every sale split, booked, and invoiced. Your agency's numbers, handled.","An income tracker for agencies. You log who paid you and who did the work, and it does the accounting: splitting every invoice into your agency fee and your team's pay, tracking it per client, per person, and per day, and rolling it all up into a dashboard. Sign in and your data is yours: it lives in your own Firestore document and nobody else can touch it.","It runs in two flavours from the same codebase. In service-agency mode you have clients, team members, and sales. In solo/brand mode you have brands, expense categories, and entries. You pick one during onboarding and can rename the terms (what you call \"Clients\", \"Team Members\", or \"Sales\") to whatever fits how you actually talk about your business."],"features":[],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/LikithSh3tty/Agenvo/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"120c1cfd4e5fee89f2f8a14737dd5ff295017e6eac6f25606ac6062c3104a8c0","extractedAt":"2026-10-08T21:27:37.838Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-16T00:57:43.630Z","projectInsights":{"version":1,"whatItDoes":{"text":"Every sale split, booked, and invoiced. Your agency's numbers, handled.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/LikithSh3tty/Agenvo/blob/main/README.md"},"audience":[],"requirements":[{"kind":"account","status":"required","text":"Sign in and your data is yours: it lives in your own Firestore document and nobody else can touch it.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/LikithSh3tty/Agenvo/blob/main/README.md"},{"kind":"account","status":"required","text":"Vite serves the app on For local auth it falls back to a bundled Firebase config, so you can sign in and click around straight away.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/LikithSh3tty/Agenvo/blob/main/README.md"}],"fingerprint":"120c1cfd4e5fee89f2f8a14737dd5ff295017e6eac6f25606ac6062c3104a8c0","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/LikithSh3tty/Agenvo/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-16T00:57:43.631Z"},"overviewRepoUpdated":"2026-08-01T12:42:18Z","readmeSnapshot":{"version":1,"status":"saved","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/LikithSh3tty/Agenvo/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-16T00:57:43.631Z","hash":"120c1cfd4e5fee89f2f8a14737dd5ff295017e6eac6f25606ac6062c3104a8c0","originalBytes":10280,"storedBytes":10280,"truncated":false},"lastDemoCheckedAt":"2026-10-16T00:57:43.492Z","subjects":["MCP servers & agents","Chatbots & assistants"],"platforms":[],"classification":{"version":4,"method":"local_rules","category":"Developer tools","subjects":["MCP servers & agents","Chatbots & assistants"],"evidence":[{"subject":"MCP servers & agents","source":"metadata","match":"LangGraph"},{"subject":"Chatbots & assistants","source":"metadata","matc